  "summary": "Immutable Diagram revisions bound into canvas checkpoints form the organizing spine. Browser editing, agent commands, generated edits, and isolated proposals converge on that model. Seventeen anchors distinguish content issuance, composition history, interactive state, durable publication, and supporting workflows. Evaluation is separated into pinned runs, experiment review, and assessment, with an explicit proposal-capture handoff. Every inventoried file received a source-text skim; implementation-level tracing concentrated on these architectural boundaries.",
